# --- Frontend (Vite) ---
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# --- Notes ---
# 1. Copy this file to .env: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values above with your actual Supabase credentials
# 3. NEVER commit your .env file (it's already in .gitignore)
#
# Supabase Edge Functions:
# Set these secrets in your Supabase dashboard (not in .env):
#   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (required for Claude AI)
#   - ELEVENLABS_API_KEY (required for text-to-speech via ElevenLabs free tier)
